NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE

The generated catalogs under ModuleData - bannerlord_assets_*.txt,
scene_catalog.xml and script_catalog.xml - are derived from Mount & Blade II:
Bannerlord's own game files. They are indexes of TaleWorlds' data, and nothing
here grants any right to that data. They are shipped only because the mod needs
them to run, and they can be regenerated from any installation with the scripts
in tools/.

Scenes and prefabs you build with this editor are yours. They reference the
game's assets by name rather than containing them, so what you export is a
layout, not a copy of anyone's art.
